            "alt": "概率问题（一） · 实战精刷9 · 讲义第125页",
            "pdfPage": 131
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "quantity-wy27-s12-t02-drill-09-explanation-02",
      "type": "text",
      "role": "explanation",
      "title": "我们这样分析 · 2",
      "questionId": "quantity-wy27-s12-t02-drill-09",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "捆绑块相邻还不等于指定个人相邻，必须继续核对块内朝向。"
        }
      ],
