    {
      "id": "quantity-wy27-s12-t02-drill-10-question",
      "type": "question",
      "title": "实战精刷 · 第10题",
      "question": {
        "id": "quantity-wy27-s12-t02-drill-10",
        "type": "single",
        "stem": "（19联考）某学校举行迎新篝火晚会，100名新生随机围坐在篝火四周。其中，小张与小李是同桌，他俩坐在一起的概率为：",
        "options": [
          {
            "value": "A",
            "label": "2/97"
          },
          {
            "value": "B",
            "label": "2/98"
          },
          {
            "value": "C",
            "label": "2/99"
          },
          {
            "value": "D",
            "label": "2/100"
          }
        ],
        "answer": "C",
        "sourceAnswer": "C"
      },
      "source": {
        "type": "pdf",
        "documentId": "quantity-wy27",
        "title": "王炎·27数量关系大满贯·讲义",
        "pages": [
          131
        ],
        "printedPages": [
          125
        ],
        "originalImages": [
          {
            "src": "assets/images/courses/quantity-wy27/quantity-wy27-s12-t02-drill-10-p131.webp",
            "alt": "概率问题（一） · 实战精刷10 · 讲义第125页",
            "pdfPage": 131
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "quantity-wy27-s12-t02-drill-10-explanation-01",
      "type": "text",
      "role": "explanation",
      "title": "我们这样分析",
      "questionId": "quantity-wy27-s12-t02-drill-10",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "讲义参考答案：C"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "我们先固定小张的位置。圆圈上他左右各有1个相邻位置，一共2个。"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "小李在剩余99个位置中等可能选座，有利位置就是这2个，所以概率为2/99，我们选C。"
        },
        {
          "type": "formula",
          "latex": "P=\\frac2{100-1}=\\frac2{99}"
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 3,
          "text": "这道题记住什么"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "圆桌两人相邻可直接定位，左右两个位置都算相邻。"
        }
      ],
